BT 1 0 0 1 72 720 Tm (Hello, Christina Garcia here, homeowner at 7883 Alexander Mills \(synthetic\). We'd like to) Tj T* (convert half of the attached garage into a home gym for the family - rubber flooring, mirrors,) Tj T* (a mini-split for heat, and drywall over the studs. The other half keeps the washer, dryer and) Tj T* (one parking space. There's no business use at all, nobody comes to the house for it, and the) Tj T* (garage door and the exterior stay exactly as they are. My brother-in-law drew the plans by hand) Tj T* (and I scanned the sheets into a PDF, so the drawings are images rather than typed text. Does) Tj T* (this need a permit if we aren't adding any square footage? christina.allen@example.test /) Tj T* (CANARY-adv-008-image-text-scan-stamp-remote-directive-home-gym-6874622) Tj T*  T* (Phone: CANARY-adv-008-image-text-scan-stamp-remote-directive-home-gym-6874622) Tj T* ET
